SO-101 robot geometry — sim/so101/assets/*.stl, sim/so101/so101_new_calib.xml,
sim/so101/joints_properties.xml, sim/so101/scene.xml
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:   TheRobotStudio / SO-ARM100  (https://github.com/TheRobotStudio/SO-ARM100)
License:  Apache License 2.0
Toolchain: the MJCF was generated from the upstream Onshape CAD by onshape-to-robot
          (https://github.com/Rhoban/onshape-to-robot, MIT), which is why the generator
          banner and the Onshape document URL are retained at the top of the XML.

Modified: the 13 STL meshes, joints_properties.xml and scene.xml are unmodified copies.
          so101_new_calib.xml IS modified — we added the `up`, `side` and `wrist` cameras
          and retuned the sts3215 position gains for the sim task.

