Contact-solver settings — sim/so101/task_scene.xml
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Source:   ggand0 / pick-101  (https://github.com/ggand0/pick-101)
License:  MIT
Used:     the grasp-stability recipe only — elliptic friction cone, noslip iterations,
          high impratio, stiff contact solref/solimp, and small finger-pad collision
          boxes. No code was copied; the scene itself is ours. Credited because getting
          a small parallel-jaw gripper to hold a cube in MuJoCo is entirely a matter of
          these settings, and we did not derive them.

